    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d451-a1">

                <pb facs="0473" n="397" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg397"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consul Dyer to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Consulate</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Ceiba</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-11-27">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 27, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report that I have the
                    following letter from the Consular Agent at Tela, dated November 15, 1916, and
                    received at this office November 23, 1916: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report that
                            Colonel Manuel Antonio López has been appointed as Comandante de Armas
                            of this port.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>This is the first information that I have received regarding the removal of the
                    Commandant which is presumably in response to the demand made through the
                    Legation that he be punished for his conduct in the Captain J. W. Grace
                    affair.</p>
                <p>I have [etc]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis J. Dyer</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
